  "publicAPIAndLimits": [
    "App::register_inspector_element<DivInspectorState> + Inspector::render_inspector_states expose actual selected Div bounds/content_size/base_style.",
    "base_style is explicit refinement, not resolved inherited style. Font12/meta16 and name12.5/500 are also independently read from frozen source; shape_line uses matching parameters.",
    "SharedString has no inspector ID/TextLayout global lookup. Its allocated label width is inferred from actual chip dimensions plus source geometry; baseline is derived, never represented as direct glyph export.",
    "Open chips contain a deferred popover child, affecting DivInspectorState.content_size. Use measured chip border box minus source padding/ring/gap for label allocation; do not interpret open content_size as label width.",
    "Heading tracks uppercase with U+200A hair spaces. Public shape_line reports ascent10.791 for this tracked string; per-run fallback fonts were not exported, so do not replace it with assumed plain-Geist ascent.",
    "Inspector picking intercepts ordinary input. Existing fixture public click_position + mouse down/up dispatch is used while inspector is closed; no private popup flag edits.",
    "Actual2x geometry is independent source evidence. Old footer R2 screenshots are scale1 and cannot be force-paired with current2x native captures.",
    "Public PlatformDisplay has no scale_factor getter; its public Debug output includes the actual WindowsDisplay scale and physical bounds. No private state is accessed or changed."
  ],
